---
import type { SiteLocale } from "@tgbox/shared";
import { ui } from "@/i18n/ui.ts";
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import { botUrl, botUsername } from "@/lib/site.ts";

interface Props {
  locale: SiteLocale;
}
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale !== "en";
const bot = `@${botUsername}`;
---

<PageLayout
  locale={locale}
  title={ui(locale).page.privacy}
  eyebrow="Privacy"
  updated="2026-11-09"
  description={zh
      ? "我们收集哪些数据、为什么收集、存放在哪里，以及你如何要求删除。"
      : "What data we collect, why, where it is stored, and how to ask for removal."}
>
  {zh ? (
      <>
        <p>我们只收集提供服务所必需的数据。浏览本站无需注册或登录。</p>

        <h2>浏览网站时</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>本站由 Cloudflare 以静态页面提供。与一般网站相同，Cloudflare 会为保障安全和防范滥用，处理 IP 地址等请求信息。</li>
          <li>我们可能使用不设置 Cookie 的访问统计（例如 Cloudflare Web Analytics）了解页面访问量。这类统计不识别个人身份。</li>
          <li>本站日后如投放广告，广告服务可能会使用 Cookie，例如用于统计展示或衡量效果。启用前，我们会更新本政策，说明这些 Cookie 的用途。</li>
          <li>你的主题偏好（亮色或暗色）只保存在你本人浏览器的 localStorage 中，不会发送给我们。</li>
          <li>站内搜索在你的浏览器内完成，搜索词不会记录到我们的服务器。</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>使用收录机器人时</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>为处理提交并通知审核结果，我们会保存你的 Telegram 用户 ID、用户名、界面语言，以及你提交的链接、分类和标签。</li>
          <li>这些信息用于审核、每日提交次数限制和防范滥用（例如限制恶意提交）。我们不会出售这些信息，也不会将其提供给第三方。</li>
          <li>通过 inline 模式搜索时，查询词只用于返回结果，不会与你的身份一并保存。</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>收录条目的数据</h2>
        <p>条目的名称、简介、头像、成员数和最近的公开消息，来自 Telegram 公开网页，并会定期更新。频道或群组转为私有、被删除或被封禁后，对应页面将自动隐藏。</p>

        <h2>数据存放与删除</h2>
        <p>数据存放在 Cloudflare 的 D1 数据库和 R2 存储中。如需删除你的提交记录，或删除你拥有的条目，请私聊 <a href={botUrl} rel="noopener" target="_blank">{bot}</a> 并发送 <code>/help</code> 获取联系方式。我们会尽快处理。</p>

        <h2>政策更新</h2>
        <p>本政策如有调整，将更新本页顶部的「最后更新」日期。</p>
      </>
    ) : (
      <>
        <p>We collect only the data needed to run the service. Browsing the site needs no registration or sign-in.</p>

        <h2>When you browse the site</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>The site is served as static pages by Cloudflare. As with most websites, Cloudflare processes request data such as IP addresses for security and abuse prevention.</li>
          <li>We may use cookieless analytics (such as Cloudflare Web Analytics) to count page views. These statistics do not identify individuals.</li>
          <li>If we run advertising later, the ad service may use cookies, for example to count impressions or measure results. Before that starts, we will update this policy and describe what those cookies are for.</li>
          <li>Your theme preference (light or dark) is kept only in your own browser’s localStorage and is never sent to us.</li>
          <li>Site search runs in your browser. Search terms are not logged on our servers.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>When you use the submission bot</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To process a submission and tell you the review result, we store your Telegram user ID, username, interface language, and the links, categories and tags you submit.</li>
          <li>This information is used for review, the daily submission limit and abuse prevention (for example, limiting malicious submissions). We do not sell it, and we do not provide it to third parties.</li>
          <li>Inline-mode search queries are used only to return results and are not stored together with your identity.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Data about listed entries</h2>
        <p>An entry’s name, description, avatar, member count and recent public posts come from public Telegram pages and are refreshed regularly. When a channel or group becomes private, is deleted or is banned, its page is hidden automatically.</p>

        <h2>Storage and removal</h2>
        <p>Data is stored in Cloudflare D1 and R2. To delete your submission history, or an entry you own, message <a href={botUrl} rel="noopener" target="_blank">{bot}</a> and send <code>/help</code> for contact details. We will handle it promptly.</p>

        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>If this policy changes, the “Last updated” date at the top of this page will change as well.</p>
      </>
    )}
</PageLayout>
